# Files NOT uploaded by `vercel deploy` (gitignore syntax). This project is not a Git repository,
# so this list is the only thing keeping secrets out of the upload: never remove the .env lines.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*serviceAccount*.json
**/*service-account*.json
**/*firebase-adminsdk*.json
**/node_modules
.firebase
# The PWA is deployed to Firebase Hosting, not Vercel. Only client/package.json is needed
# (npm workspaces require every workspace manifest).
client/*
!client/package.json
server/test
server/scripts
*.md
